        "Content": "Moran Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this elevated site extending to approximately 0.3504 hectares / 0.866 acres.\r\nThe site enjoys an attractive rural setting with good views towards Derryhick Lough and across the surrounding countryside.\r\nLocated approximately 4 km from Parke Village and within convenient reach of Castlebar, the property offers a pleasant countryside setting with good accessibility to local services and amenities.\r\n\r\nNOTE: Any information, description, measurement or statement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report issued by or on behalf of Moran Auctioneers or the vendor are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact or to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract. Moran Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy of the particulars. Interested parties must conduct their due diligence by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Moran Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
